  "priorExpiration": "2016-01-12",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3205.03 Attendance at Inspection Overview Session.\n\n(a) All mechanics who seek approval to conduct inspections shall attend one department inspection overview session for each type of vehicle they intend to inspect at a time and location as determined by the Director. All mechanics shall be pre-registered for the overview session. Each mechanic may be required to attend a refresher session, as necessary.\n\n(b) The director shall require any mechanic who has either demonstrated a lack of knowledge of inspection laws or rules or who has been found to have intentionally or knowingly violated inspection laws or rules, to attend the inspection overview session and/or undergo a mechanic field test in accordance with Saf-C 3205.04.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3200.html"
